IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DMA-OFFLOAD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-PAGES         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BANDWIDTH-GBPS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 LATENCY-US-X10      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TRANSFERRED-PAGES   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DMA-OFFLOAD.
    MOVE 64 TO BANDWIDTH-GBPS.
    MOVE 125 TO LATENCY-US-X10.
    MOVE TOTAL-PAGES TO TRANSFERRED-PAGES.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TRANSFERRED-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 BANDWIDTH-GBPS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
